      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VOMO ISLAND (2) is the horse to beat after putting a gap on them over 1200m here last start, beating Dublin Red by 2.8L. His run prior over this track and trip has plenty of merit after he was held up near straightening, He has already beaten RIPPER RUPERT and DOOR BUSTER recently and he can repeat the dose with a favourable set-up. RIPPER RUPERT (5) came back from Saturday grade last time out but never featured over this track and trip when drawing wide. Now draws much better with Fiore on board and it wouldn't surprise to see him turn his form right around. DOOR BUSTER (6) resumes from a break with two wins from three at the Kalgoorlie 1100m, and her July win over Dancewithme reads well for this. CHIPILLY (10) has been safely held at her past two, though her track-and-trip profile and lighter weight keep her in the place mix. DREAMERS NEVER DIE (4) can't be left out of calculations.",
